# IPv4 / IGMP Membership Query bootstrap fixture.
# IGMP fixed header: RFC 1112/RFC 9776 Type 0x11, Code 0 (v1-compatible),
# checksum over the IGMP message, and zero Group Address.
# Addresses use RFC 5737 source space and RFC 5771 multicast documentation
# destination space; this is not captured live traffic.
